		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Magenta dragon-kin found near badlands and magical wastes. Two legs and wings, no arms.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d6) or 1 toxic gout, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acidblood</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Toxic Gout</strong>. Gout a gobbet of toxic waste within double near. All creatures in a near- sized cube around where the blast lands, DEX 12+ or 1d10 damage and move at half speed for 1 round. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
